WEBVTT

NOTE Silent video. Cues are the on-screen step captions; the terminal text is in the transcript.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.867
join: id: The manifest names pages by their id field, not their path. join: id says which field.

2
00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:21.133
Rename the page: The page moved; its entry did not. The values arrive by id, and the new path passes.

3
00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:26.067
One id, two pages: dup-a and dup-b both say id: shared. That is a finding on both, and each names the other.

4
00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:35.067
The id is the join: query refuses to change the id of a page the manifest matched. Change the manifest first.

5
00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:39.833
Exit codes for CI: 1 for findings. 2 for the refusal. A rename is neither: nothing to edit, nothing orphaned.

